+# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the op-fusion programme's host-gap package WPH (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
+# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the fusion integration branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
+# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. WPH/ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
+# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag the pack's B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
+# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
+# H11a (CONTROL PLACEMENT, WPH-4): the smoke container exactly as every card job starts it today: --cpus 8, no pinning, docker's default weight.
+# The host-gap package's scheduler experiment (docs/tp4-fusion-wph.md): the instrumented fx-all run again, with the scheduler's side recorded - the container cgroup's CPU-bandwidth counters on every round
+# line, a thread census every 25th step, what each fence waited behind, and a line for every copy that blocked a millisecond or more - ARC PAUSED (min/max 0 on the rig's runner sets; the owner restores
+# them), so the host is as quiet as a timed card job makes it. NO WPH LEVER IS ON: the arm is c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-wph-log, the combined arm plus the instrument.
+# READ: python3 scripts/ci/hostgap_read.py <container log>: the EIGHT-LIVE table (window, launch, fence, collect), the EXPOSED line, CPU BANDWIDTH (throttled periods of the container cgroup),
+# THREADS (quota, cpuset, the busiest threads and the CPUs they sit on), BLOCKED CALLS (what a blocked copy followed) and WHAT THE FENCE WAITED BEHIND. Compare H11a with H11b round for round (probe and
+# census steps are dropped by the reader). Duration (estimate): 45 minutes.
+C2_CARDS=quad
+C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
+C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
+C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-wph-log
+C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_32k
